      "translations": [
        "My little brother is eight, and he loves playing football.",
        "He said: “I want a ball of my own.”",
        "Today is his birthday. I gave him a new ball.",
        "He was really happy. We went outside to play together. The weather was lovely.",
        "He can't run fast, but he loves running.",
        "By the evening he was already exhausted, but he still wanted to play. We're going again tomorrow."
